    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/0/0e/Murasaki_Root_of_Calamity_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250621041612\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Murasaki Root of Calamity Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/0/0e/Murasaki_Root_of_Calamity_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250621041612\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"469\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Murasaki Root of Calamity Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Murasaki_Root_of_Calamity_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>灾厄之根  </b>\n\n紫(紫)是《闪乱神乐》游戏系列中的可玩角色，首次出现在《闪乱神乐：少女们的选择》中。她是蛇城隐密女子学院的二年级学生，也是伊姆的妹妹。\n\n</p><p>她缺乏社交技能，更喜欢和她的泰迪熊贝贝比(日语为贝贝酱)待在房间里。尽管很容易成为蛇城的精英之一，但她从不上学，是历史上最危险的忍者。\n\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">外观</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMurasaki%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>紫有着及踝的长波浪紫色头发，刘海上方系着黑色缎带，投下浓重的阴影遮住眼睛，使眼睛失去光泽，看起来比平时更暗，常常给她一种整体忧郁的神态。她穿着一件带灰色饰边的黑色长裙，胸部突出。\n\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\">性格</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMurasaki%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>她通常非常温和且爱好和平，然而，灾厄之根会在她受惊或生气时改变这一点。\n\n</p><p>受灾厄之根影响时，她的性格会短暂地显著改变。她开始用更低沉的声音说话，并积极试图杀死她愤怒的目标，过程中常常大声尖叫。\n\n</p><p>值得注意的是，紫对生活相当愤世嫉俗。她认为友谊是谎言，拒绝相信有人依靠能让人变强的观点。用她自己的话说，她相信人类天生是孤独的生物。她经常以最坏的恶意揣测他人，并且真诚地惊讶于来自如此不同世界的人能成为朋友。  <a href=\"/wiki/Yomi\" title=\"Yomi\">Yomi</a>  和  <a href=\"/wiki/Ikaruga\" title=\"Ikaruga\">Ikaruga</a>  能成为朋友。她愤世嫉俗的世界观反映在她对媒体的偏好上，她最喜欢的故事充满了谋杀、抑郁和毒品滥用等黑暗主题。\n\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260821131819\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.010 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:39949-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260821131819 and revision id 64364. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
